   "@id": "stmt:20261109-0952",
   "@type": "AuthorStatement",
   "date": "2026-11-09T09:52-05:00",
   "where": "in session, on an unprimed ChatGPT reading of the v1.0 hologram; first deposited with this kernel",
   "text": "unprimed chatgpt just characterized revelation first as having withdrawn the josephus thesis... but to my knowledge i have not withdrawn the josephus thesis - i have suspended advancing the argument as too speculative to advance until the literary genetic argument is more firmly established. i still hold it as highly likely, particularly given the slavonic josephus materials. is all the evidence represented?"
  },
